FSOT-2012-Mac-Mini
Copyright 2026 Damian Arthur Palumbo

This product contains FSOT measurements and benchmarks on Late 2012
Mac mini hardware (Macmini6,1).
This repository is part of the FSOT (Fluid Spacetime Omni-Theory) family.
Theory authority is vendor/fsot_compute.py in
https://github.com/dappalumbo91/FSOT-2.1-Lean (pin AEB2AD), also by
Damian Arthur Palumbo and licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

The iGPU benchmark loads the system OpenGL / EGL libraries (libGL.so.1,
libEGL.so.1) at runtime; they are not bundled.
